  "video_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e",
  "account": "林睿读书&书在橱窗",
  "source_title": "从太行绝壁上的天窗画框，到喀斯特峰林里的天堂之路；从夏天沉入湖底的最美水上公路，到被老百姓捧红的草原天路；再到死亡之海里种出的绿色生命长廊。五条路，一条比一条惊艳，但还不是最美#中国最美公路  #公路旅行 #自驾游#航拍中国",
  "title_is_metadata_not_transcript": true,
  "input_mode": "text_only",
  "status": "AI_PENDING",
  "unit_index": 1,
  "unit_count": 1,
  "all_video_unit_ids": [
    "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_u01"
  ],
  "duration_s": 375.769002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "你知道吗？咱们国家公路总里程已经超过五百四十万公里，能绕地球一百多圈。可要说哪一条最美？那争议可就大了。有人说是川藏线中国人的景观大道。有人说是独库公路一日观四季，十里不同天错，真要论其美，这个字川藏线和独库公路连前山都进不去。今天咱们我们就来盘点中国十大最美公路。先讲第十到第六一条比一条好看。老规矩，开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听第十名。河南郭亮挂壁公路在河南新乡辉县太行山的绝壁上，这条路最绝的是他挂在悬崖上一千二百五十米长的隧道外侧，找薄了三十五个天窗。每一个天窗都是一个天然的画框。您坐在车里往外看，太行山大峡谷就在画框里，一座山连着一座山，悬崖，一层叠着一层谷底的村子，小的像火柴盒，云从山谷里升起来又散开。隧道里的光是一段一段的天窗，进来一束暗一段再进来一束，再按一段车在光影里穿行，像在放幻灯片，红颜绝壁就在您右手边，伸手就能摸到这哪是开车。这是在山肚子里看画展。第九名，广西河那高速从合浦到那坡，全长五百一十六公里，这条路最绝的是他全程穿行在卡斯特枫林里，一座座圆圆的石头山，从地里长出来，绿绿的一座挨着一座像一片石头做的波浪车在路面上走，山峰从车窗两边涌过来，又退到后面去路，两边的甘蔗田和香蕉林，春天是绿的，秋天是黄的云雾从山谷里升起来的时候，整条路就像飘在云上英国的劲报，管他叫天堂之路。您想想，一条高速被外国人叫天堂，这风景得多好看。江西永无蚣路，在江西九江永修县鄱阳湖上全长五公里多，这条路最绝的是他会消失。每年六七月份，鄱阳湖涨水，湖水漫过路面最深的时候，一米多，整条公路沉到水底，下车开过去，水从车轮两边分开，两边全是湖面。天连着水水莲的天车就像在水上漂，所以这条路又叫最美水上公路。到了十月，水退了，公路露出来，湖底变成草州、白鹤、天鹅、大雁全飞来了。鄱阳湖是中国最大的淡水湖，全世界百分之九十八的白鹤都到这儿过冬一条路。夏天在水里，冬天在草上天上飞的是鸟，水里游的是鱼。您说这是公路还是通到天上去的路？第七名，河北草原天路在河北张家口、张北和崇礼交界，全长一百三十二公里。这条路最绝的是他修在山脊上，海拔一千四到一千八，两边全是草原，一边是坝上，一边是坝下。从车窗看出去，草坡，一浪一浪风车，一座一座梯田，一层一层桦树林，一片一片。夏天二十度凉风，从车窗灌进来，满眼都是绿。秋天麦田金黄跟火烧过一样。这条路本来是一条乡道，没人知道，后来自驾的人来了，拍了照片发到网上，一年之内火了一年，来过五十万辆车，一条乡道被老百姓捧成了中国六十六号公路，您说这是路美还是老百姓的眼睛？毒？第六名，新疆塔里木沙漠公路在新疆从轮台到民丰，全长五百六十六公里。这条路最绝的是他修在死亡之海里塔克拉玛干沙漠中国最大的沙漠。世界第二大流动沙漠维吾尔语里，塔克拉玛干的意思是进得去出不来，这条路就修在这片沙漠上。公路两边种了将近两千万株梭梭和洪柳，织成了两堵一层楼高的绿墙。车在路上走，就像在植物砌的滑道里滑行，外面是黄沙，里面是绿色，外面是死亡之海，里面是生命之路。您说这是路还是跟沙漠打的一场仗？从第十到第六，郭亮，挂壁公路天窗是画框河，那高速穿行在枫林里永无公路。夏天在水里，草原天路被老百姓捧红了，塔里木沙漠公路跟死亡之海打了一仗，可这五条还不是最美的。接下来第五道第一，一条比一条震撼，有一条路一天能过四个季节，有一座桥架，在云端上他是哪条，他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，您先点个关注点，开头像别走丢。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 770,
      "text": "你知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00002",
      "start_ms": 990,
      "end_ms": 5330,
      "text": "咱们国家公路总里程已经超过五百四十万公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5630,
      "end_ms": 7610,
      "text": "能绕地球一百多圈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00004",
      "start_ms": 8130,
      "end_ms": 9630,
      "text": "可要说哪一条最美？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9910,
      "end_ms": 11430,
      "text": "那争议可就大了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11910,
      "end_ms": 15750,
      "text": "有人说是川藏线中国人的景观大道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00007",
      "start_ms": 16110,
      "end_ms": 19830,
      "text": "有人说是独库公路一日观四季，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00008",
      "start_ms": 20170,
      "end_ms": 22010,
      "text": "十里不同天错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00009",
      "start_ms": 22490,
      "end_ms": 23790,
      "text": "真要论其美，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00010",
      "start_ms": 23910,
      "end_ms": 29010,
      "text": "这个字川藏线和独库公路连前山都进不去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00011",
      "start_ms": 29370,
      "end_ms": 33580,
      "text": "今天咱们我们就来盘点中国十大最美公路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00012",
      "start_ms": 34300,
      "end_ms": 38320,
      "text": "先讲第十到第六一条比一条好看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00013",
      "start_ms": 38440,
      "end_ms": 39040,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00014",
      "start_ms": 39240,
      "end_ms": 40040,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00015",
      "start_ms": 40340,
      "end_ms": 42380,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00016",
      "start_ms": 42620,
      "end_ms": 45660,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听第十名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00017",
      "start_ms": 46060,
      "end_ms": 52020,
      "text": "河南郭亮挂壁公路在河南新乡辉县太行山的绝壁上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00018",
      "start_ms": 52580,
      "end_ms": 59580,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是他挂在悬崖上一千二百五十米长的隧道外侧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00019",
      "start_ms": 59580,
      "end_ms": 61545,
      "text": "找薄了三十五个天窗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00020",
      "start_ms": 62420,
      "end_ms": 65675,
      "text": "每一个天窗都是一个天然的画框。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00021",
      "start_ms": 66090,
      "end_ms": 67795,
      "text": "您坐在车里往外看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00022",
      "start_ms": 68630,
      "end_ms": 71085,
      "text": "太行山大峡谷就在画框里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00023",
      "start_ms": 71780,
      "end_ms": 73785,
      "text": "一座山连着一座山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00024",
      "start_ms": 74470,
      "end_ms": 74990,
      "text": "悬崖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00025",
      "start_ms": 75050,
      "end_ms": 77610,
      "text": "一层叠着一层谷底的村子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00026",
      "start_ms": 77750,
      "end_ms": 78850,
      "text": "小的像火柴盒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00027",
      "start_ms": 79130,
      "end_ms": 81745,
      "text": "云从山谷里升起来又散开。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00028",
      "start_ms": 82280,
      "end_ms": 86170,
      "text": "隧道里的光是一段一段的天窗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00029",
      "start_ms": 86270,
      "end_ms": 89135,
      "text": "进来一束暗一段再进来一束，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00030",
      "start_ms": 89700,
      "end_ms": 92975,
      "text": "再按一段车在光影里穿行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00031",
      "start_ms": 93570,
      "end_ms": 95025,
      "text": "像在放幻灯片，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00032",
      "start_ms": 95600,
      "end_ms": 98605,
      "text": "红颜绝壁就在您右手边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00033",
      "start_ms": 99000,
      "end_ms": 101905,
      "text": "伸手就能摸到这哪是开车。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00034",
      "start_ms": 102420,
      "end_ms": 104505,
      "text": "这是在山肚子里看画展。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00035",
      "start_ms": 105090,
      "end_ms": 105695,
      "text": "第九名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00036",
      "start_ms": 106350,
      "end_ms": 110925,
      "text": "广西河那高速从合浦到那坡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00037",
      "start_ms": 111450,
      "end_ms": 114015,
      "text": "全长五百一十六公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00038",
      "start_ms": 115020,
      "end_ms": 120025,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是他全程穿行在卡斯特枫林里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00039",
      "start_ms": 120260,
      "end_ms": 122155,
      "text": "一座座圆圆的石头山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00040",
      "start_ms": 122780,
      "end_ms": 124300,
      "text": "从地里长出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00041",
      "start_ms": 124460,
      "end_ms": 131915,
      "text": "绿绿的一座挨着一座像一片石头做的波浪车在路面上走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00042",
      "start_ms": 132680,
      "end_ms": 135125,
      "text": "山峰从车窗两边涌过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00043",
      "start_ms": 135650,
      "end_ms": 138280,
      "text": "又退到后面去路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00044",
      "start_ms": 138280,
      "end_ms": 140470,
      "text": "两边的甘蔗田和香蕉林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00045",
      "start_ms": 140750,
      "end_ms": 141990,
      "text": "春天是绿的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00046",
      "start_ms": 142070,
      "end_ms": 146775,
      "text": "秋天是黄的云雾从山谷里升起来的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00047",
      "start_ms": 147060,
      "end_ms": 150755,
      "text": "整条路就像飘在云上英国的劲报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00048",
      "start_ms": 151130,
      "end_ms": 153305,
      "text": "管他叫天堂之路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00049",
      "start_ms": 154040,
      "end_ms": 154715,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00050",
      "start_ms": 155100,
      "end_ms": 158240,
      "text": "一条高速被外国人叫天堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00051",
      "start_ms": 158740,
      "end_ms": 160200,
      "text": "这风景得多好看。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00052",
      "start_ms": 160380,
      "end_ms": 162005,
      "text": "江西永无蚣路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00053",
      "start_ms": 162470,
      "end_ms": 167805,
      "text": "在江西九江永修县鄱阳湖上全长五公里多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00054",
      "start_ms": 168430,
      "end_ms": 171185,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是他会消失。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00055",
      "start_ms": 172310,
      "end_ms": 173690,
      "text": "每年六七月份，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00056",
      "start_ms": 173770,
      "end_ms": 174755,
      "text": "鄱阳湖涨水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00057",
      "start_ms": 175250,
      "end_ms": 178140,
      "text": "湖水漫过路面最深的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00058",
      "start_ms": 178140,
      "end_ms": 178845,
      "text": "一米多，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00059",
      "start_ms": 179210,
      "end_ms": 181170,
      "text": "整条公路沉到水底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00060",
      "start_ms": 181170,
      "end_ms": 183185,
      "text": "下车开过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00061",
      "start_ms": 183520,
      "end_ms": 185505,
      "text": "水从车轮两边分开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00062",
      "start_ms": 185920,
      "end_ms": 187295,
      "text": "两边全是湖面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00063",
      "start_ms": 187570,
      "end_ms": 191715,
      "text": "天连着水水莲的天车就像在水上漂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00064",
      "start_ms": 192150,
      "end_ms": 195705,
      "text": "所以这条路又叫最美水上公路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00065",
      "start_ms": 196220,
      "end_ms": 197020,
      "text": "到了十月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00066",
      "start_ms": 197260,
      "end_ms": 197875,
      "text": "水退了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00067",
      "start_ms": 198370,
      "end_ms": 199410,
      "text": "公路露出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00068",
      "start_ms": 199610,
      "end_ms": 204815,
      "text": "湖底变成草州、白鹤、天鹅、大雁全飞来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00069",
      "start_ms": 205270,
      "end_ms": 208385,
      "text": "鄱阳湖是中国最大的淡水湖，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00070",
      "start_ms": 208920,
      "end_ms": 213205,
      "text": "全世界百分之九十八的白鹤都到这儿过冬一条路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00071",
      "start_ms": 213520,
      "end_ms": 214505,
      "text": "夏天在水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00072",
      "start_ms": 214950,
      "end_ms": 217455,
      "text": "冬天在草上天上飞的是鸟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00073",
      "start_ms": 217750,
      "end_ms": 218815,
      "text": "水里游的是鱼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00074",
      "start_ms": 219230,
      "end_ms": 221855,
      "text": "您说这是公路还是通到天上去的路？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00075",
      "start_ms": 222160,
      "end_ms": 222800,
      "text": "第七名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00076",
      "start_ms": 223180,
      "end_ms": 228665,
      "text": "河北草原天路在河北张家口、张北和崇礼交界，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00077",
      "start_ms": 229210,
      "end_ms": 231145,
      "text": "全长一百三十二公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00078",
      "start_ms": 231710,
      "end_ms": 234965,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是他修在山脊上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00079",
      "start_ms": 235380,
      "end_ms": 237180,
      "text": "海拔一千四到一千八，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00080",
      "start_ms": 237420,
      "end_ms": 238985,
      "text": "两边全是草原，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00081",
      "start_ms": 239370,
      "end_ms": 240410,
      "text": "一边是坝上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00082",
      "start_ms": 240610,
      "end_ms": 241685,
      "text": "一边是坝下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00083",
      "start_ms": 242390,
      "end_ms": 243935,
      "text": "从车窗看出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00084",
      "start_ms": 244200,
      "end_ms": 244685,
      "text": "草坡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00085",
      "start_ms": 245000,
      "end_ms": 246580,
      "text": "一浪一浪风车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00086",
      "start_ms": 246720,
      "end_ms": 248410,
      "text": "一座一座梯田，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00087",
      "start_ms": 248590,
      "end_ms": 250535,
      "text": "一层一层桦树林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00088",
      "start_ms": 250870,
      "end_ms": 251715,
      "text": "一片一片。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00089",
      "start_ms": 252180,
      "end_ms": 254190,
      "text": "夏天二十度凉风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00090",
      "start_ms": 254190,
      "end_ms": 255655,
      "text": "从车窗灌进来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00091",
      "start_ms": 256030,
      "end_ms": 257125,
      "text": "满眼都是绿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00092",
      "start_ms": 257770,
      "end_ms": 261015,
      "text": "秋天麦田金黄跟火烧过一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00093",
      "start_ms": 261520,
      "end_ms": 263475,
      "text": "这条路本来是一条乡道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00094",
      "start_ms": 263830,
      "end_ms": 264610,
      "text": "没人知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00095",
      "start_ms": 264850,
      "end_ms": 266395,
      "text": "后来自驾的人来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00096",
      "start_ms": 266820,
      "end_ms": 268665,
      "text": "拍了照片发到网上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00097",
      "start_ms": 269060,
      "end_ms": 271330,
      "text": "一年之内火了一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00098",
      "start_ms": 271350,
      "end_ms": 272885,
      "text": "来过五十万辆车，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00099",
      "start_ms": 273320,
      "end_ms": 277360,
      "text": "一条乡道被老百姓捧成了中国六十六号公路，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00100",
      "start_ms": 277440,
      "end_ms": 280800,
      "text": "您说这是路美还是老百姓的眼睛？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00101",
      "start_ms": 280800,
      "end_ms": 281125,
      "text": "毒？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00102",
      "start_ms": 281550,
      "end_ms": 282065,
      "text": "第六名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00103",
      "start_ms": 282700,
      "end_ms": 288020,
      "text": "新疆塔里木沙漠公路在新疆从轮台到民丰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00104",
      "start_ms": 288360,
      "end_ms": 290164,
      "text": "全长五百六十六公里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00105",
      "start_ms": 291670,
      "end_ms": 299375,
      "text": "这条路最绝的是他修在死亡之海里塔克拉玛干沙漠中国最大的沙漠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00106",
      "start_ms": 299980,
      "end_ms": 303160,
      "text": "世界第二大流动沙漠维吾尔语里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00107",
      "start_ms": 303520,
      "end_ms": 307240,
      "text": "塔克拉玛干的意思是进得去出不来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00108",
      "start_ms": 307700,
      "end_ms": 310040,
      "text": "这条路就修在这片沙漠上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00109",
      "start_ms": 310940,
      "end_ms": 315779,
      "text": "公路两边种了将近两千万株梭梭和洪柳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00110",
      "start_ms": 315900,
      "end_ms": 318660,
      "text": "织成了两堵一层楼高的绿墙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00111",
      "start_ms": 319260,
      "end_ms": 320280,
      "text": "车在路上走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00112",
      "start_ms": 320640,
      "end_ms": 323260,
      "text": "就像在植物砌的滑道里滑行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00113",
      "start_ms": 323860,
      "end_ms": 325060,
      "text": "外面是黄沙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00114",
      "start_ms": 325300,
      "end_ms": 326260,
      "text": "里面是绿色，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00115",
      "start_ms": 326660,
      "end_ms": 328240,
      "text": "外面是死亡之海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00116",
      "start_ms": 328480,
      "end_ms": 330130,
      "text": "里面是生命之路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00117",
      "start_ms": 330670,
      "end_ms": 334250,
      "text": "您说这是路还是跟沙漠打的一场仗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00118",
      "start_ms": 334850,
      "end_ms": 336590,
      "text": "从第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00119",
      "start_ms": 336950,
      "end_ms": 337430,
      "text": "郭亮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00120",
      "start_ms": 337550,
      "end_ms": 340470,
      "text": "挂壁公路天窗是画框河，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00121",
      "start_ms": 340530,
      "end_ms": 343370,
      "text": "那高速穿行在枫林里永无公路。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00122",
      "start_ms": 343370,
      "end_ms": 344370,
      "text": "夏天在水里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00123",
      "start_ms": 344770,
      "end_ms": 347110,
      "text": "草原天路被老百姓捧红了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00124",
      "start_ms": 347530,
      "end_ms": 350650,
      "text": "塔里木沙漠公路跟死亡之海打了一仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00125",
      "start_ms": 351070,
      "end_ms": 353390,
      "text": "可这五条还不是最美的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00126",
      "start_ms": 354570,
      "end_ms": 356330,
      "text": "接下来第五道第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00127",
      "start_ms": 356730,
      "end_ms": 358845,
      "text": "一条比一条震撼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00128",
      "start_ms": 359500,
      "end_ms": 362005,
      "text": "有一条路一天能过四个季节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00129",
      "start_ms": 362290,
      "end_ms": 363850,
      "text": "有一座桥架，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00130",
      "start_ms": 363850,
      "end_ms": 366665,
      "text": "在云端上他是哪条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00131",
      "start_ms": 367130,
      "end_ms": 369975,
      "text": "他凭什么排第一下集马上更新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00132",
      "start_ms": 370970,
      "end_ms": 373250,
      "text": "您先点个关注点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_b5a70a0074b9ac7e_s00133",
      "start_ms": 373250,
      "end_ms": 375685,
      "text": "开头像别走丢。"
    }
  ],
